    "code": " def AC():\n\n    a, b, p, x = map(int, input().split())\n\n    ans = 0\n\n    m = 1\n\n    for i in range(p - 2):\n\n        m = (m * a) % p\n\n    rem = 1\n\n    inv = 1\n\n    Ch = p * (p - 1)\n\n    for n in range(1, p):\n\n        rem = (rem * a) % p\n\n        inv = (inv * m) % p\n\n        cur = min(p, ((n * rem - b) * inv + p) % p)\n\n        rep = n + cur * (p - 1)\n\n        ans += max(0, (x - rep + Ch) // Ch)\n\n    print(ans)\n\nAC()",
